      "writtenOn": "2024-02-03T07:06:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s probably better to advertise the amount of free disk space required instead of total size.  An internal checkout with `-g all`, unpacked chroot, and a single build weighs in at less than 200 GB.  Most public devs will likely require significantly less than that.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 46,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 46,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "c83dfcabbbce1956edf91dbdc1d863cb062e3fd5",
